{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unleash your dragon spirit in a high-flying, co-op brawler from developers who\u2019ve contributed to iconic franchises like Spider-Man, Crash Bandicoot, and Skylanders!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by industry veterans from Beenox and Ubisoft, <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> is a vibrant side-scrolling beat \u2018em up where teamwork, transformation, and over-the-top fun collide.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7e0f7ff3f7d1b01a054764c2fcc8c5db.poster.avif?t=1772510907\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7e0f7ff3f7d1b01a054764c2fcc8c5db.webm?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7e0f7ff3f7d1b01a054764c2fcc8c5db.mp4?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mystical world of \u00dcna, where ancient power stirs and chaos rises. As one of eight dragon-bound champions, battle through monster-infested lands, master unique fighting styles, and transform into awe-inspiring dragons to reclaim balance. Whether you're flying solo or brawling alongside friends, prepare for a fiery showdown!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/896302a2c00b331cab178b68f6447fc3.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 8<strong>\u00a0distinct heroes</strong>, each infused with the soul of a dragon. Master their combat styles, build devastating combos, and unleash their dragon forms in the heat of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/f8005105897f64b29d4fc22f84db1511.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through hordes of enemies with fluid controls and dynamic attacks. Fight across colorful, hand-crafted levels in both <strong>solo</strong> and <strong>multiplayer</strong> modes. Unlock upgrades, push your skills, and face off against increasingly formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/25bd4028a3ca47483ddd9c536be13c74.poster.avif?t=1772510907\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/25bd4028a3ca47483ddd9c536be13c74.webm?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/25bd4028a3ca47483ddd9c536be13c74.mp4?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/ca11a036ddc53d7d87ae59c359783aab.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to <strong>3 players online or in local couch co-op</strong> in Adventure Mode, or challenge your friends in wild <strong>competitive brawls</strong>. Want to win? Prove your mettle by outlasting your rivals and mastering the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/4a62d06e8ecbdf84e36d0c602e4e832a.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add a twist to any match with hilarious curses: <strong>shrink your opponents, flip their controls, or turn them into a frog</strong>. Disrupt their rhythm and turn the tides in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/5e30c2fdc9a8fc441099eda13a9e8bbd.poster.avif?t=1772510907\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/5e30c2fdc9a8fc441099eda13a9e8bbd.webm?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/5e30c2fdc9a8fc441099eda13a9e8bbd.mp4?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/480a1f7726b208adc52e2597ec2e5cb1.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually striking world where <strong>2D hand-drawn art</strong> is brought to life in 3D. Every realm bursts with color, depth, and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/a566b2123f3086d5647213acf5044c17.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world teeters on the edge of destruction. The <strong>Celestial Dragon</strong>, last of her kind, has vanished\u2014and only the <strong>Dragon-Souls</strong>, heroes bound to her legacy, can uncover the truth and restore order. Awaken the power within. And fight to become the legend \u00dcna needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b9763c9192be8843788611d7a57924a3.poster.avif?t=1772510907\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b9763c9192be8843788611d7a57924a3.webm?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b9763c9192be8843788611d7a57924a3.mp4?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b8e06973b75d32d24fbaaf9e39001ef2.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> is the debut title from <strong>RuniQ</strong>, founded by<strong> veterans from Beenox</strong>\u2014the studio behind <i>Crash Team Racing Nitro-Fueled</i>, <i>Spider-Man: Shattered Dimensions</i>, and <i>Skylanders</i>. With decades of combined experience and a passion for crafting memorable games, the team brings triple-A expertise to a heartfelt indie project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backed by prestigious accolades like the <strong>Catapulte Pitching Contest</strong> and <strong>GDC Pitch Day 2024</strong>, and supported by the <strong>Canada Media Fund</strong> and <strong>Valo-Capitale</strong>, RuniQ is forging the next big universe in action gaming. Their partnership with <strong>HMD Creations</strong> ensures the <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> IP expands far beyond the screen\u2014with books, board games, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Are you ready to become a Dragon-Soul?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dragon in Training","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/adc1ed34f90a27343718e3bc2ab0ca857cbe89c1.jpg"},{"name":"Valiant Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/ddd4076df0bf48402af213468d021af478f03fc3.jpg"},{"name":"Hardcore Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/1cf77ef755cd2994a4ba33ed3214e2672b3c9aa1.jpg"},{"name":"Vanquisher of the Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/d21bff497362b85e6ad4f89350399891f6c239f3.jpg"},{"name":"Spider Squisher Extraordinaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/b76020b735d275bc0d54de99341c49acae650704.jpg"},{"name":"Purifier of Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/5bfca41b867d27dc2fa68123e3175dd31b5bec66.jpg"},{"name":"Breaker of Madness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/4d0ae4f02089abf583229cef46565fcaf6566ff7.jpg"},{"name":"Bane of Malverick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/9d8a5a314df5c9f763226a2303612c05717c102b.jpg"},{"name":"Breeze Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/3d04a29d3d33c60b35f494e3fa65ec89e69060be.jpg"},{"name":"Harvestor of Glory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733070/fdc240b6298091b4262f82bc9ed8acd0471351ec.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2733070?t=1772510907","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/e702e976256388e3bf9371c8983b7ed5d7ed313f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772510907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/08b24f85eadd9e545628d7ef93fd5cc1c636ec66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772510907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/08b24f85eadd9e545628d7ef93fd5cc1c636ec66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772510907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unleash your dragon spirit in a high-flying, co-op brawler from developers who\u2019ve contributed to iconic franchises like Spider-Man, Crash Bandicoot, and Skylanders!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by industry veterans from Beenox and Ubisoft, <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> is a vibrant side-scrolling beat \u2018em up where teamwork, transformation, and over-the-top fun collide.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7e0f7ff3f7d1b01a054764c2fcc8c5db.poster.avif?t=1772510907\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7e0f7ff3f7d1b01a054764c2fcc8c5db.webm?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7e0f7ff3f7d1b01a054764c2fcc8c5db.mp4?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mystical world of \u00dcna, where ancient power stirs and chaos rises. As one of eight dragon-bound champions, battle through monster-infested lands, master unique fighting styles, and transform into awe-inspiring dragons to reclaim balance. Whether you're flying solo or brawling alongside friends, prepare for a fiery showdown!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/896302a2c00b331cab178b68f6447fc3.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 8<strong>\u00a0distinct heroes</strong>, each infused with the soul of a dragon. Master their combat styles, build devastating combos, and unleash their dragon forms in the heat of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/f8005105897f64b29d4fc22f84db1511.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through hordes of enemies with fluid controls and dynamic attacks. Fight across colorful, hand-crafted levels in both <strong>solo</strong> and <strong>multiplayer</strong> modes. Unlock upgrades, push your skills, and face off against increasingly formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/25bd4028a3ca47483ddd9c536be13c74.poster.avif?t=1772510907\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/25bd4028a3ca47483ddd9c536be13c74.webm?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/25bd4028a3ca47483ddd9c536be13c74.mp4?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/ca11a036ddc53d7d87ae59c359783aab.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to <strong>3 players online or in local couch co-op</strong> in Adventure Mode, or challenge your friends in wild <strong>competitive brawls</strong>. Want to win? Prove your mettle by outlasting your rivals and mastering the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/4a62d06e8ecbdf84e36d0c602e4e832a.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add a twist to any match with hilarious curses: <strong>shrink your opponents, flip their controls, or turn them into a frog</strong>. Disrupt their rhythm and turn the tides in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/5e30c2fdc9a8fc441099eda13a9e8bbd.poster.avif?t=1772510907\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/5e30c2fdc9a8fc441099eda13a9e8bbd.webm?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/5e30c2fdc9a8fc441099eda13a9e8bbd.mp4?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/480a1f7726b208adc52e2597ec2e5cb1.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually striking world where <strong>2D hand-drawn art</strong> is brought to life in 3D. Every realm bursts with color, depth, and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/a566b2123f3086d5647213acf5044c17.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world teeters on the edge of destruction. The <strong>Celestial Dragon</strong>, last of her kind, has vanished\u2014and only the <strong>Dragon-Souls</strong>, heroes bound to her legacy, can uncover the truth and restore order. Awaken the power within. And fight to become the legend \u00dcna needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b9763c9192be8843788611d7a57924a3.poster.avif?t=1772510907\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b9763c9192be8843788611d7a57924a3.webm?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b9763c9192be8843788611d7a57924a3.mp4?t=1772510907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b8e06973b75d32d24fbaaf9e39001ef2.avif?t=1772510907\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> is the debut title from <strong>RuniQ</strong>, founded by<strong> veterans from Beenox</strong>\u2014the studio behind <i>Crash Team Racing Nitro-Fueled</i>, <i>Spider-Man: Shattered Dimensions</i>, and <i>Skylanders</i>. With decades of combined experience and a passion for crafting memorable games, the team brings triple-A expertise to a heartfelt indie project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backed by prestigious accolades like the <strong>Catapulte Pitching Contest</strong> and <strong>GDC Pitch Day 2024</strong>, and supported by the <strong>Canada Media Fund</strong> and <strong>Valo-Capitale</strong>, RuniQ is forging the next big universe in action gaming. Their partnership with <strong>HMD Creations</strong> ensures the <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> IP expands far beyond the screen\u2014with books, board games, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Are you ready to become a Dragon-Soul?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RuniQ"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/952b0dac803750fe578ae8992ffa694b4e147726/header.jpg?t=1772510907","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Heroes of Mount Dragon\u2122 \u00a9 2025 HMD Creations inc. Licensed to RuniQ Studio inc. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2733070/267346289/c8f9def733c2ae70e2225a88568a40c40d6d4d60/1758656758/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758735983","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2733070/267346289/c8f9def733c2ae70e2225a88568a40c40d6d4d60/1758656758/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758735983","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akam